00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.917 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enfin arrivé.

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:17.951 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai très, très hâte de me

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.986 size:53% position:73% line:53%
faire vacciner, très hâte que

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.987 size:53% position:73% line:53%
