00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:21.021 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vaccinés aussi.

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:22.055 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Après des mois d'attente, la

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:23.290 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vaccination sera progressivement

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:24.524 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ouverte au grand public

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:25.726 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dès cette semaine.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.960 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Maintenant, il n'y a plus

00:00:24.825 --> 00:00:28.161 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aucun doute, on va réaliser

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:29.363 size:53% position:73% line:53%
notre objectif du 24 juin.

00:00:27.261 --> 00:00:30.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- À compter de demain,

00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:31.832 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les 50-59 ans pourront

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:33.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
